Subject: [PATCH 19/48] fftools/ffprobe: print the multiview and depth
 information side data

Print every field of the multiview and depth information side data of
frames, packets and streams, real numbers as their values.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 via Claude Code
---
